options.description:
search modules from the directory;
--arg name value      set $name to a string value;
--argjson name value  set $name to a JSON value;
--slurpfile name file set $name to an array of JSON values;
--rawfile name file   set $name to the file's string contents;

show this help;
--                    terminate argument processing.
Named arguments are also in $ARGS.named; positional arguments are in $ARGS.positional. jq language documentation: https://jqlang.org/
